  "details": "On the download page on the website, it would be good to include a checksum for the SDK, for us to verify the integrity of the file we download. This method can be automated in the server of course. \n\nFor those who don’t know, a file checksum allows you to verify that the file is actually the correct file. This is checked by either running a console command or a program that will give you the info or validate the input you give it.  Short explained.\n\nThis would be low priority of course, but nice to see in the future.",
